<meta charset='UTF-8'><html><head><title>Web@RiscV@FPGA</title><style>body{text-align:center;margin:30px;font-family:Arial;}.banner{border:2px solid #2196F3;padding:20px;margin-bottom:20px;display:inline-block;}.banner h2{color:#2196F3;margin:5px;}.banner p{color:#666;margin:3px;font-size:12px;}button{width:200px;padding:12px;margin:8px;font-size:16px;border:1px solid #2196F3;background:#fff;color:#2196F3;cursor:pointer;}button:hover{background:#2196F3;color:#fff;}.info{margin-top:20px;font-size:13px;color:#888;line-height:1.6;}</style></head><body><div class='banner'><h2>RiscV@FPGA 嵌入式网关</h2><p>MAC 白名单上网控制系统</p><p>基于 RISC-V + FPGA 硬件加速 | 千兆线速 MAC 白名单过滤</p><p>Layer-2 Transparent Bridge | 即插即用</p></div><br><button onclick="location='/localconfig'">本机配置</button><br><button onclick="location='/wlconfig'">白名单配置</button><div class='info'>FPGA: Xilinx XC7A35T-FGG484 | CPU: RISC-V RV32IC @ 50MHz<br>接口: 1xRGMII + 2x1000BASE-X (全千兆)<br>Copy Right @ Buck 2026</div></body></html>